# Admin filter tabs (legacy)

Any list page in the app should use `ListSearchBar` (see `list-pages` rule), not `AdminFilterTabs`.

If `AdminFilterTabs` is still used elsewhere:

1. Import from `@/components/admin-filter-tabs`.
2. Do **not** rely on Tailwind `text-white` alone on `<Link>` for the selected state.
3. Selected styling lives in `globals.css`: `.filter-tab-active` = white text on brand blue.
